# NAO ATIVO: o token do gh nao tem escopo "workflow" para criar este arquivo em .github/workflows. Quando tiver, mover para la. Ate la, tools/publish.py faz build + guarda + publicacao no branch gh-pages.
# R5 (03/09/2026): o site so' vai ao ar depois de passar no build (sem comentarios internos, com build-id)
# e na guarda de promessas proibidas. Depois do deploy, uma verificacao EXTERNA confere que manaaapp.com
# serve exatamente este commit. Se qualquer passo falhar, o deploy nao acontece (fica a versao anterior).
name: build-guard-deploy
on:
  push:
    branches: [master]
  workflow_dispatch:
permissions:
  contents: read
  pages: write
  id-token: write
concurrency:
  group: pages
  cancel-in-progress: false
jobs:
  build:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: actions/setup-python@v5
        with: { python-version: '3.12' }
      - name: Build + guarda (falha se houver promessa proibida)
        run: python tools/build_site.py "${GITHUB_SHA}" . _site
      - uses: actions/configure-pages@v5
      - uses: actions/upload-pages-artifact@v3
        with: { path: _site }
  deploy:
    needs: build
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    environment:
      name: github-pages
      url: ${{ steps.deployment.outputs.page_url }}
    steps:
      - id: deployment
        uses: actions/deploy-pages@v4
  verificar:
    needs: deploy
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - name: Espera a borda servir o novo build e confere de fora
        run: |
          esperado="${GITHUB_SHA:0:12}"
          for i in $(seq 1 20); do
            v=$(curl -s -H 'Cache-Control: no-cache' "https://manaaapp.com/version.json?nc=$RANDOM" | sed -n 's/.*"build_id": *"\([^"]*\)".*/\1/p')
            [ "$v" = "$esperado" ] && break
            sleep 15
          done
          bash tools/check_site.sh "$esperado"
